## 3. Benchmarking Framework & Canonical Sources

To validate your approach without bias, your experimental runs must be evaluated against the standard **Nature CNN architecture** trained via **Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO)**.

The baseline benchmarks and hyperparameters are sourced directly from **Stable-Baselines3 (SB3) RL Baselines3 Zoo**, which replicates and stabilizes the original configurations from OpenAI's *Proximal Policy Optimization Algorithms* (Schulman et al., 2017).

### Canonical Hyperparameter Specification

Your custom PPO heads running on top of your FSQ representations must match these configurations exactly to isolate the feature extractor as the single independent variable:

| Hyperparameter | Value | Source Baseline Reference |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Total Timesteps** | `10,000,000` ($10\text{M}$) | SB3 Atari Benchmark Standard |
| **Number of Envs (`n_envs`)** | `8` (Vectorized) | Schulman et al., 2017 / SB3 Zoo |
| **Rollout Steps (`n_steps`)** | `128` per environment | Schulman et al., 2017 / SB3 Zoo |
| **Mini-batch Size** | `256` | SB3 Zoo Atari Config |
| **Optimization Epochs** | `4` per rollout batch | Schulman et al., 2017 / SB3 Zoo |
| **Base Learning Rate** | `2.5e-4` | Schulman et al., 2017 / SB3 Zoo |
| **LR Schedule** | **Linear Decay** (down to `0.0`) | SB3 Zoo Atari Config |
| **Discount Factor ($\gamma$)** | `0.99` | Standard Atari Horizon |
| **GAE Parameter ($\lambda$)** | `0.95` | Schulman et al., 2017 |
| **Clip Parameter ($\epsilon$)** | `0.1` | SB3 Zoo Atari Config |
| **Entropy Coef (`ent_coef`)** | `0.01` | Exploration Regularization Standard |
| **Value Function Coef** | `0.5` | Critic Loss Scaling |
| **Gradient Clipping** | `0.5` (`max_grad_norm`) | Optimization Stability |

> **Source Verification Registry:**
> * **PPO Algorithm:** Schulman, J., Wolski, F., Dhariwal, P., Radford, A., & Klimov, O. (2017). *Proximal Policy Optimization Algorithms*. arXiv preprint arXiv:1707.06347.
> * **Hyperparameter Configs:** Stable-Baselines3 RL Baselines3 Zoo (`rl_zoo3/cfg/ppo.yml`). Checkpoints hosted under the official `sb3` organization on Hugging Face.
